1968..2046 Comment "/// Rotating by `b` and back is the identity (cubical\'s `rotInv-1`, `b · a ·"
2047..2127 Comment "/// invLooper b ≡ a`, `_·_` associating to the left). The obligation over `a`"
2128..2203 Comment "/// moves `mul(b, a)` through its second argument, but `mul`\'s case is over"
